ue" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>Data to seek: construct-level synonymous data with native full UTR–CDS + continuous fresh outcome in an independent host; Cambray 2018 fixed-UTR needs raw verification first.</p></content></shape><shape width="864" height="30" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="460" presetHandlers="6" type="round-rect"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(204, 251, 241, 1)"/></fill><content fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)"/></shape><shape width="836" height="21" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="464" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="8.8" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(13, 148, 136, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>Six missing dimensions recorded (synonymous library · native UTR · full cross-host CDS · continuous outcome · family map · provenance); no mismatched dataset substituted.</p></content></shape><shape width="780" height="13" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="512" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="8.2" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100, 116, 139, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>Source: result 9b02373b460a · pivot_plan · RK23 protein-OOD 0/4 · RK25 mechanism 0/2</p></content></shape><shape width="62" height="15" topLeftX="850" topLeftY="510" type="text"><content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="10" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31, 41, 55, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" textAlign="right" wrap="false"><p>172</p></content></shape></data><note><content><p>With no qualifying independent data, branch 3 records the missing dimensions rather than substituting a mismatched dataset.</p><p>This formally triggers the branch-2 pivot: stop treating start-aware MFE as the core innovation and move to functional sequence modeling.</p><p>RK37 is a preregistered functional prediction benchmark with strong controls and a strict SOTA gate; generative training stays unauthorized.</p></content></note></slide>
